# Instructor / TA MAC addresses that get full Internet access even on the
# student `cs326` SSID.  One per line.  Manage with:
#   classnet staff add aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff
#   classnet staff del aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff
#   classnet staff list
#
# NOTE: turn OFF "Private Wi-Fi Address" (macOS/iOS) or "Randomised MAC"
# (Android/Windows) for this SSID, or the address will not match.
# MACs are cleartext on the air and spoofable -- the cs326-staff SSID is the
# stronger path; this list is the convenience path.
